msgid "The shape of the result, expressed as width:height. Wider ratios suit landscapes; taller ratios suit portraits."
msgstr "Umbo la tokeo, kama upana:urefu. Uwiano mpana unafaa picha mlalo; uwiano mrefu unafaa picha wima."

msgid "The detail level of the result. Higher settings can preserve finer detail and produce larger files."
msgstr "Kiwango cha maelezo ya tokeo. Mipangilio ya juu inaweza kuhifadhi maelezo laini na kutoa faili kubwa."

msgid "The dimensions and orientation of the generated image."
msgstr "Vipimo na uelekeo wa taswira iliyotengenezwa."

msgid "How many images to create in one generation."
msgstr "Taswira ngapi za kuunda katika utengenezaji mmoja."

msgid "The visual treatment applied to the generated image."
msgstr "Mtindo wa kuona unaotumika kwenye taswira iliyotengenezwa."

msgid "Generate surface color and appearance for the mesh."
msgstr "Tengeneza rangi ya uso na mwonekano wa matundu."

msgid "Generate material maps for physically based shading, so the surface responds to scene lighting."
msgstr "Tengeneza ramani za nyenzo za kivuli kinachotegemea fizikia, ili uso uitikie mwangaza wa mandhari."

msgid "The maximum polygon budget for the mesh. A lower limit keeps geometry lighter; a higher limit allows more detail."
msgstr "Bajeti ya juu ya poligoni ya matundu. Kikomo cha chini huweka jiometri nyepesi; kikomo cha juu huruhusu maelezo zaidi."

msgid "The requested polygon count. Lower values keep the mesh lighter; higher values allow more geometric detail."
msgstr "Idadi iliyoombwa ya poligoni. Thamani za chini huweka matundu mepesi; thamani za juu huruhusu maelezo zaidi ya jiometri."

msgid "The target polygon count after simplification. Lower values reduce geometry and may remove small details."
msgstr "Idadi lengwa ya poligoni baada ya kurahisisha. Thamani za chini hupunguza jiometri na zinaweza kuondoa maelezo madogo."

msgid "The level of detail used when generating surface textures."
msgstr "Kiwango cha maelezo kinachotumika unapotengeneza miundo ya uso."

msgid "The pixel dimensions of the texture maps. Larger maps can hold finer detail and use more memory."
msgstr "Vipimo vya pikseli vya ramani za muundo. Ramani kubwa zinaweza kushikilia maelezo laini na kutumia kumbukumbu zaidi."

msgid "Rebuild the mesh's topology as part of generation."
msgstr "Jenga upya topolojia ya matundu kama sehemu ya utengenezaji."

msgid "Request topology built from four-sided faces for easier mesh editing."
msgstr "Omba topolojia iliyojengwa kutoka nyuso za pande nne ili kuhariri matundu iwe rahisi."

msgid "How finely the model separates the input into parts. Finer settings can separate smaller details."
msgstr "Jinsi modeli inavyogawanya ingizo katika sehemu kwa umaridadi. Mipangilio laini inaweza kutenganisha maelezo madogo."

msgid "Separate disconnected pieces of geometry into individual parts."
msgstr "Tenganisha vipande vya jiometri visivyounganishwa kuwa sehemu za kibinafsi."

msgid "Include generated sound with the video."
msgstr "Jumuisha sauti iliyotengenezwa na video."

msgid "Create mesh geometry from the input."
msgstr "Unda jiometri ya matundu kutoka ingizo."

msgid "Reduce mesh complexity after reconstruction."
msgstr "Punguza ugumu wa matundu baada ya kujenga upya."

msgid "The minimum mask area, in pixels. Increasing it filters out smaller regions."
msgstr "Eneo la chini la kinyago, kwa pikseli. Kuongeza huchuja maeneo madogo."

msgid "Store color on the mesh vertices; the available color detail depends on the geometry."
msgstr "Hifadhi rangi kwenye vipeo vya matundu; maelezo ya rangi yanayopatikana yanategemea jiometri."

msgid "Bake surface appearance into texture maps for the mesh."
msgstr "Oka mwonekano wa uso kwenye ramani za muundo za matundu."

msgid "How the generated asset is compressed for storage and transfer."
msgstr "Jinsi rasilimali iliyotengenezwa inavyogandamizwa kwa hifadhi na uhamishaji."

msgid "How generated textures are aligned to the source image or mesh geometry."
msgstr "Jinsi miundo iliyotengenezwa inavyopangiliwa na taswira ya chanzo au jiometri ya matundu."

msgid "Controls the random starting point. Reusing a seed with the same settings helps compare variations."
msgstr "Hudhibiti mahali pa kuanzia kwa nasibu. Kutumia tena mbegu na mipangilio ileile husaidia kulinganisha tofauti."

msgid "Controls the random starting point for texture generation. Reuse it with the same settings to compare variations."
msgstr "Hudhibiti mahali pa kuanzia kwa nasibu cha utengenezaji wa muundo. Itumie tena na mipangilio ileile kulinganisha tofauti."

msgid "The type of rig to create for posing and animating the mesh."
msgstr "Aina ya rigi ya kuunda kwa kuweka misimamo na kuhuisha matundu."

msgid "The skeleton structure used to rig the mesh."
msgstr "Muundo wa mifupa unaotumika kuweka rigi kwenye matundu."

msgid "How strongly the generation follows its guidance. Higher values emphasize that guidance."
msgstr "Jinsi utengenezaji unavyofuata mwongozo wake kwa nguvu. Thamani za juu husisitiza mwongozo huo."

msgid "The number of refinement steps used during generation. More steps can take longer."
msgstr "Idadi ya hatua za uboreshaji zinazotumika wakati wa utengenezaji. Hatua zaidi zinaweza kuchukua muda mrefu."

msgid "The file format used to store the generated image."
msgstr "Umbizo la faili linalotumika kuhifadhi taswira iliyotengenezwa."

