msgid "New Image"
msgstr "Picha Mpya"

msgid ""
"Create a new image (Tiled enabled by default)\n"
"\n"
"Wrapper around `image.new` that pre-sets `tiled=True` on the\n"
"operator's property dialog. Used as the `new=` operator for\n"
"`template_ID` in Mixar UV panels so the dialog opens with the\n"
"Tiled checkbox already checked. The underlying `image.new` does\n"
"the actual creation and ID assignment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Unda taswira mpya (Yenye vigae imewashwa kwa chaguomsingi)\n"
"\n"
"Kifuniko cha `image.new` kinachoweka `tiled=True` mapema kwenye\n"
"kirisha cha sifa za opereta. Hutumika kama opereta wa `new=` kwa\n"
"`template_ID` katika majopo ya UV ya Mixar ili dirisha lifunguke na\n"
"kisanduku cha Yenye vigae tayari kimechaguliwa. `image.new` ya chini hufanya\n"
"uundaji halisi na ukabidhi wa kitambulisho.\n"

